  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "A kit is a small set of pieces that build many spaces: a wall, an opening, a column, a step, a light. You pick one reference image and model the 3\u20135 pieces it is made of, at real size, then keep each piece as a prefab.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Which three to five pieces would build most of your reference?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Choose: one reference image; list its 3\u20135 repeated pieces with their sizes in metres.\n2. Build: model each piece with ProBuilder next to the figure, with the Kit materials.\n3. Keep: save each piece as a prefab in Assets/My-Kit and place a few copies to test them.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 1\u20134 \xB7 Unity basics, Assets-And-Prefabs 4 and 8</color></size>"
